pl_mpeg.h is PL_MPEG by Dominic Szablewski (https://github.com/phoboslab/pl_mpeg), vendored from
commit c871f2be022ece7ef4f64230b4fb8e1fb9eb6023 (2025-12-30) with three speed changes for the 3DS,
each marked "sh23ds:" (inline VLC bit reads, a lookup table for DCT coefficient codes, motion
compensation on 32-bit words). Their output is bit-exact with the original (see port/MOVIES.md).
The header carries "SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT"; the licence text follows.

